{ This test specification is primarily designed to test
  the commenting features of the catpart testing tool.
  Note that nested comments are _not_ allowed.
}
{ but several comments _are_ allowed }
A {the identifying letter} Function: {a key word} comment {the name}
  Categories: {the categories follow}
{same-line comments should be ok anywhere} 1 foo {the category name}
    * {comments also ok here} choice a [error]
    * choice b {ok here?} [property b] {and here?}
  2 bar
 {the bar category} * choice c [if b]{sneaky comment}[property c]
    * choice d
EndFunction; { A trailing comment on a newline probably causes a syntax error }
